      "caption": "🚜 POOL EXCAVATION | BOERNE, TX 🏊‍♂️\n\nAnother pool project breaking ground in Boerne, Texas!\n\nA successful pool installation starts with proper site preparation. Our team handled the excavation and site work needed to get this backyard prepared and ready for the next stage of construction.\n\nFrom tight-access residential projects to larger excavation jobs, Legacy Contracting Solutions LLC has the equipment and experience to get the job done efficiently and correctly.\n\nOUR SERVICES:\n✅ Pool Excavation & Site Preparation\n✅ Skid Steer & Excavation Services\n✅ Grading & Leveling\n✅ Dirt & Material Haul-Off\n✅ Land Clearing\n✅ Demolition & Debris Removal\n✅ Residential & Contractor Services\n\nWhether you’re a homeowner, pool builder, or contractor, we’re available for complete projects or simply to provide the equipment, excavation, and hauling your crew needs.\n\n📍 Boerne, TX | San Antonio & Surrounding Areas\n📞 210-840-8533\n📩 DM for estimates & scheduling\n\nLegacy Contracting Solutions LLC\nBuilt from the ground up.\n\n#LegacyContractingSolutions #PoolExcavation #BoerneTX #BoerneTexas #PoolConstruction ExcavationContractor SkidSteerServices DirtWork LandClearing SanAntonioContractor SanAntonioTX TexasContractor",
