      "caption": "🪵 FENCE REFURBISHMENT & STAINING | \n\nNot every fence needs to be torn down and replaced. This existing wood fence still had life left in it, so we refurbished the fence and applied a fresh stain to bring the wood back to life and give the property a completely refreshed look.\n\n✅ Existing fence refurbished\n✅ Wood prepped for staining\n✅ Fresh stain applied\n✅ Improved appearance & protection\n✅ Cost-effective alternative to replacement\n\nIf your fence is weathered and faded but still structurally sound, refurbishing and staining may be all it needs.\n\n📞 210-840-8533\n🌐 LegacyContractingSolutionsLLC.com⁠￼\n📩 DM or call for a free estimate\n\nLegacy Contracting Solutions LLC\nSetting the Standards of Quality and Trust.\n\n#FenceStaining #FenceRestoration #WoodFence #SanAntonioContractor #LegacyContractingSolutions",
